# [rc4l] Build context for Dockerfile.master. BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference
# to the root .dockerignore, which excludes everything (that one serves Dockerfile.linux-build, whose
# image is a toolchain with the source mounted at runtime -- the opposite shape to this one).
#
# Start from nothing and re-admit only what the daemon compiles: ~20 MB instead of the whole tree.
# wadsrc/ (game data), deps/, build dirs and dist output are all irrelevant to a UDP daemon.
*

!src/zandronum/masterserver
!src/zandronum/src
!src/zandronum/tools/updaterevision

# [rc4l] .git is admitted so updaterevision can stamp the real revision into the banner; it is the
# largest single item in the context (~61 MB) but keeps the running daemon self-identifying, which
# matters when several masters federate and you need to know which build one is. Drop this line if
# you would rather have a faster build than an accurate `Revision:` line.
!.git
